plot3d(k, "Stoch Helix", "helix", "#b48cff", "separate")`},{name:"ADX Vortex Funnel",description:'Trend strength (ADX) as a six-armed converging spiral tornado ("vortex" style)',category:"3D Visualizations",source:`// ADX Vortex Funnel
adxLen = input(14, "ADX Length")
strength = adx(high, low, close, adxLen)
plot3d(strength, "Trend Vortex", "vortex", "#ff4477", "separate")`},{name:"CCI Manifold Sheet",description:'CCI as a flowing wireframe manifold ribbon — multi-spline market topology ("manifold" style)',category:"3D Visualizations",source:`// CCI Manifold Sheet
