c = cci(high, low, close, cciLen)
plot3d(c, "CCI Manifold", "manifold", "#22aaff", "separate")`},{name:"Money Flow Nebula",description:'MFI as a glowing volumetric particle cloud — money-flow atmosphere ("nebula" style)',category:"3D Visualizations",source:`// Money Flow Nebula
